<title>UK: NIB sets NZ$70 million September 1999 bond.</title>
<headline>NIB sets NZ$70 million September 1999 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Tokyo-Mitsubishi International and Tokyo -Securities Co.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NATIONAL INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$ 70 MLN    COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    16.SEP.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    16.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.50	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   NO</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.50</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
